    "Spread your open tasks and reviews over the week's free time. Planned on this PC, nothing is added until you say so" : {
      "comment" : "The Schedule's Plan button tooltip on Windows in the Week view (the Mac says Mac).",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
